{"t":"Old Pirate Poem (Book)","s":"old-pirate-poem-book-3d42b","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Old_Pirate_Poem_40a065.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Untitled</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Old Pirate Poem\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Old_Pirate_Poem_40a065.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Noodles%20Academy%20of%20Modern%20Magic\">Ivory Towers</a>.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"blurb\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Short Description</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">This may lead you to somewhere special...</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"author\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Author</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Some pirate.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatedpages\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Related Articles</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Carving\">Giant Tree (Carving)</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/treasure-hunt-quest\">Treasure Hunt Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Very%20Old%20Piece%20of%20Paper\">Very Old Piece of Paper</a>.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"returnpage\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Return to</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Edron Libraries.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.50<br/>July 1, 2009<br/>Summer Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Libraries <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Part of the <a href=\"#/quest/treasure-hunt-quest\">Treasure Hunt Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-text\">\n<blockquote class=\"book\"><p><br/>Set the sails to the carved tree<br/>\n</p><p>the head of a dragon south shall it be<br/>\n34 feet in the line to the west<br/>\nthe next one goes under arrest<br/>\nthe master's secret must be revealed<br/>\n</p><p>\nto open the path that once were sealed</p></blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["treasure-hunt-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"treasure-hunt-quest","quest":"Treasure Hunt Quest","step":"0-2","n":3,"title":"Buscar o poema (1 hora depois)","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33268,"y":31838,"z":6,"label":"Wyrdin"}]}]}}